@methods: bequest
# The methods of the terminal stage `bequest`, whose stage file is
# applications/benhabib-2019/declaration/stages/bequest/bequest.bl, as an
# addition to that file: the derivative of the warm-glow bequest in wealth,
# in closed form, appended to the decision value builder. The block keeps the
# partial signature of the block file marginals_bequest.bl, whose empty domain
# adds nothing and whose codomain names the one output the stage already
# declares, so that the union of the two signatures is the stage's.

[id=cntn_to_dcsn, () -> (V) : !dcsn] {
    D_{a}V = (A/β)*a^(-μ)                    :: [id=marginal]
}
